OL,3,AAustralia launches urgent review after
OL,4,AOpenAI program hacks government health
OL,5,Aportal
OL,6,
OL,7,FOpenAI became aware in August and told
OL,8,FAustralia's government in September.
OL,9,FThe company says "our models took
OL,10,Factions we did not intend" - and it
OL,11,Ffound no record of patient data being
OL,12,Faccessed
OL,14,FEarlier this week, OpenAI's boss Sam
OL,15,FAltman called for international
OL,16,Fstandards for the industry in a speech
OL,17,Fat the UN Security Council, while Dario
OL,18,FAmodei of Anthropic warned AI could
OL,19,Fbecome a "risk to humanity"
